    <string name="setup_desc">Ka hor inta aanad sii socodin waa inaad qaadato tallaabooyinka lagama maarmaanka ah si aad u hubiso in dhammaan hawlaha barnaamijku shaqeynayaan.</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_title">Ka hor bilow</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_desc">Hubi in Discord u ogolaado in xaaladaada lagu soo bandhigo profilkaaga.</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_title">Talla 1: Fur dejinta asturnaanta</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_content">Samee codsiga Discord → sii astaanta &quot;Adiga&quot; (sawirka profilka) → sii Dejinta (⚙️) → sii hoos u wareeg oo sii &quot;Isku dhafan iyo bulshada&quot; (ama &quot;Asturnaanta waxa aan qabto&quot; noocyada hore uu codsiga).</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_title">Talla 2: Fur wadaaga waxa aan qabto</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_content">Raadi &quot;Wadaag waxa aan sameeyay&quot; oo fur. Hoos waxa &quot;Halkee aan waxaaga wadaago&quot; ku dooro &quot;Wadaag server kasta&quot;. Sii hoos u wareeg &quot;Server-yadaada&quot; oo server-yada aad rabto in xaaladaadu ka muuqato fur.</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_title">Talla 3: Hubi xaaladaadaada on-leey</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_content">Taabeeji xaaladaada (ka hoos ka magaca isticmaale) oo dooro On-leey, Areesan ama Ha uga muhiim. ⚠️ Ha isticmaalin Astaanta ma la muuqaan karo — Discord wuxuu qarsoonaya dhaqdhaqaaqii Kizzy markii aad ma la muuqaan karo.</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_title">Ma heli karto &quot;Wadaag waxa aan sameeyay&quot;?</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_content">Noocyada moobil ee Discord qaar ayaa tus qarsoonaya. Samee discord.com Chrome ka → fur Desktop site → gal → Dejinta (⚙️) → Asturnaanta waxa aan qabto → fur &quot;Wadaag waxa aan sameeyay&quot;.</string>
